# Lv.1-30 Poké Ball Cup, all eight rounds to the Cup clear, with the weak-COM aid (@weak_com: the COM's shown Pokémon
# at 1 HP, the rest of its team at 0, alike on both sides), so each round is one turn: Nidoqueen's C-Up move wins it.
# Entry as tournament_l30.route (five rentals beside the cartridge's Pikachu), but 1P sends Nidoqueen, Nidoking and
# Dodrio (A, C-Down, C-Up on the order screen). Each round: the command phase (sync:cmd), the hit, the results board,
# かち, the round token on the cap and トーナメントをつづけますか？ (A: つづける), then the next round's title, VS
# panels and order screen. After round 8: チャンピオン! and the parade of the winning team.
# The C-Right and C-Down taps before A in each turn do nothing in the command menu; they pick the replacement if 1P's
# Pokémon has fainted (not needed with the aid, kept so the turn works either way).
@gb green
@rng 1
@weak_com
@window 12 200
1200 START 300 A 400 shot:main_menu
A 200 A 200 shot:battle_mode RIGHT 40 shot:tour_cursor
A 300 shot:tour_select A 300 shot:l30_menu A 300 shot:cup_select 100
A 200 shot:entry 100 A 200 shot:rentals_prompt 100 A 150 shot:rental_list
A 120 shot:rental_card 30 A 150 shot:rental_taken A 150 A 150 A 150 A 150 A 150 A 150 A 150 shot:rental_card5 A 300 shot:team_confirm
A 60 shot:entry_done 150 shot:stadium_fly 200 shot:screen_flames 130 shot:round_title 160 shot:trainer_panels 120 shot:vs
